---
layout: base.njk
title: Stories
description: Milestones in Ran Craycraft’s career, written as case studies, from launching ventures at AOL to leading thoughtbot’s Americas business and Ruby Central.
permalink: /stories/
section: stories
---
<section class="page-head">
  <h1 class="serif display">Stories</h1>
  <p class="serif lede">The milestones. Each one is a longer look at a piece of work I led, what the situation was, what I did, and what changed.</p>
</section>

<ol class="milestones">
  {%- for p in collections.posts | milestones %}
  {%- set cs = p.data.case_study %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ p.url }}" class="milestone">
      <span class="milestone-when small muted">{{ cs.years }}</span>
      <span class="milestone-body">
        <span class="small muted">{{ cs.organization }}{% if cs.role %} · {{ cs.role }}{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="milestone-title serif">{{ p.data.title }}</span>
        <span class="muted">{{ p.data.description }}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="milestone-cover">{% set ratio = "4 / 3" %}{% include "cover.njk" %}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ol>
